{"ref":"card:hypothesis","text":"Denser angular search improves best50 DockQ by finding better poses, while fixed scoring can leave rank1 worse.","sources":[]}
{"ref":"card:if_lever","text":"At 54000 rotations, best50 DockQ rises beyond 0.01 and noise; rank1 changes separately, with both arms completing matched budgets.","sources":[]}
{"ref":"card:if_not","text":"At 54000 rotations, best50 DockQ stays within 0.01 or noise, worsens, or fails matched budgets; rank1 may worsen.","sources":[]}
{"ref":"card:test_summary","text":"Build sealed three-arm controller; validate CPU/GPU agreement at 3600 rotations, then compare GPU 54000 against GPU and CPU 3600 under common workflow caps, retaining 50 poses and separate per-case rank1/best50 DockQ.","sources":[]}
{"ref":"card:closest_prior","text":"MEGADOCK measured runtime through 1000000 docking jobs [prior]; guide documents 54000 rotations [angles], without fixed-50 DockQ width comparisons.","sources":[{"id":"prior","url":"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4221127/","quote":"In this simulation, a half million docking jobs required 5.71 h, while a million jobs required 11.51 h."},{"id":"angles","url":"https://www.bi.cs.titech.ac.jp/megadock/usage_ja.html","quote":"6°刻みの場合54000通りの角度，15°刻みの場合3600通りの角度で計算します．"}]}
{"ref":"card:left_open","text":"Whether 54000 versus 3600 rotations improves rank1 or best50 on these four apo cases while completed workflows meet common budgets.","sources":[]}
{"ref":"card:anchor","text":"CPU standard anchors GPU poses and scores; independent transform reconstruction and DockQ fixtures validate evaluation before dense comparisons.","sources":[{"id":"dockq","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bjornwallner/DockQ/master/README.md","quote":"By default, DockQ will try to find the optimal mapping between interfaces found in the native and in the model."}]}
{"ref":"card:limits","text":"Four previously examined cases; prospective replication after exploratory exposure, not unseen validation. No biological efficacy, population generalization or saturation plateau.","sources":[]}
{"ref":"src:prior","url":"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4221127/","quote":"In this simulation, a half million docking jobs required 5.71 h, while a million jobs required 11.51 h.","supports":"Published large-batch runtime result on a different axis; no maximum rotation count established for those runs, hence null prior_max_level. Article also describes distributing ligand rotations across CPU cores and GPUs; plan uses existing implementation."}
{"ref":"src:angles","url":"https://www.bi.cs.titech.ac.jp/megadock/usage_ja.html","quote":"6°刻みの場合54000通りの角度，15°刻みの場合3600通りの角度で計算します．","supports":"Official standard/dense angular counts; -D selects dense. Sizes, not a quality scaling law."}
{"ref":"src:dockq","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bjornwallner/DockQ/master/README.md","quote":"By default, DockQ will try to find the optimal mapping between interfaces found in the native and in the model.","supports":"Model/native evaluation and mapping policy; README documents fixed mapping, example and JSON output."}
